{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《愛．回家之開心速遞》昨晚（27日）一集「大小姐」林淑敏決定不再做「工具人」，離開接龍另起爐灶，引爆迴響！ 講到「大小姐」龍力蓮（林淑敏飾）自得悉父親龍敢威（羅樂林飾）會將接班人的位傳給阿Joe（何晉樂飾）後心情低落，天天以淚洗面，故決定請大假逃離傷心地。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h02m26s875.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026nisnwOf7Mc1785212282.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h02m26s875.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">不過力蓮依然心繫接龍，得知公司出現問題，暗中出手協助解決問題。這一切被熊尚善（滕麗名 飾）看在眼裏，當場一語道破指責她：「你唔好犯賤啦！明知唔屬於你嘅嘢，放手呀！」 力蓮自言明知這樣做是犯賤，惟她做不到不理會公司，「熊尚善你唔係我，我所有嘅青春都放晒喺接龍，我咁愛佢，點解佢最愛嘅人唔係我呀！」 她愈講愈激動說：「佢係渣男我知㗎，但每次佢有事我都聽唔住撲佢身邊幫佢，我知道犯賤，但我真係放唔低」並聲淚俱下表示「唔要做工具人」更哀求熊尚善幫助她，尚善勸她放手，惟力蓮不想放棄自己多年的付出，終尚善送上擁抱安慰，場面感動。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h04m00s649.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20261vfFreKzcw1785212280.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h04m00s649.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h02m56s176.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263byOY9G9LE1785212281.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h02m56s176.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">其後，力蓮得知她曾遭敢威否決的計劃書中標後，清楚明白到自己的實力，決定離開接龍另起爐灶，向龍敢威辭職兼遞上自己新公司「力蓮集團」的卡片堅定表示：「我唔想認命！」 讓敢威當場暴怒失算。更意想不到的是，熊尚善亦緊接着遞上辭職信，接龍兩大核心巨頭同時離職、攜手離場，場面極度震撼！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 這集播出後引爆迴響，網上洗版式討論，力撐「大小姐」決定做得好，又指今集催淚十足，紛紛留言「又睇到喊咗，離開接龍係一個最好嘅決定」、「喊到收唔到聲」、「恭喜大小姐終於離開接龍，離開個渣男」、「好心痛大小姐」、「今集睇得好爽」。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h05m59s831.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026tYp0kZP8jd1785212282.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h05m59s831.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h07m48s331.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026FK8ozcIv2a1785212282.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h07m48s331.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T04:38:30.203854+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":639,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}